  { number := 303, text := "Nationals of these jurisdictions MAY contribute if they dedicate the Contribution under the Unlicense. Hong Kong is included although it is not a United Nations member. The other forty five named United Nations members on this list are United Nations members. This list is the Allow list. The map in Clause 4.19 is not this list." },
